## Protection Paladin (Classic Era 1.15)
## Sources: Classic Era paladin tanking guides (Wowhead Classic Protection Paladin tank guide, Warcraft Tavern Protection
## Paladin guide, Classic paladin Discord): Righteous Fury always, Holy Shield on cooldown, Seal of Righteousness judged
## on cooldown and resealed, Consecration as the main (AoE) threat while mana lasts, Blessing of Sanctuary on yourself.
## Seal choice, judgement debuff, mana limits, Consecration and self-Blessing are in the Paladin settings.

actions.precombat+=/righteous_fury,if=buff.righteous_fury.down
actions.precombat+=/blessing_of_sanctuary,if=!any_blessing&self_blessing_sanctuary
actions.precombat+=/blessing_of_kings,if=!any_blessing&self_blessing_kings
actions.precombat+=/blessing_of_might,if=!any_blessing&(self_blessing_might|self_blessing_auto_might)
actions.precombat+=/blessing_of_wisdom,if=!any_blessing&self_blessing_wisdom
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_the_crusader,if=jd_crusader&buff.seal_of_the_crusader.down
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_wisdom,if=jd_wisdom&buff.seal_of_wisdom.down
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_light,if=jd_light&buff.seal_of_light.down
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_righteousness,if=use_sor&need_main_seal
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_command,if=use_soc&need_main_seal
actions.precombat+=/seal_of_wisdom,if=use_sow&need_main_seal

actions+=/hammer_of_justice
actions+=/righteous_fury,if=buff.righteous_fury.down
## AoE: Consecration is the main threat on packs.
actions+=/consecration,if=active_enemies>1
actions+=/holy_shield
## Judgement debuff (setting): cast its seal just before Judgement is ready, judge it, then go back to the main seal.
actions+=/seal_of_the_crusader,if=jd_crusader&buff.seal_of_the_crusader.down&cooldown.judgement.remains<gcd.max
actions+=/seal_of_wisdom,if=jd_wisdom&buff.seal_of_wisdom.down&cooldown.judgement.remains<gcd.max
actions+=/seal_of_light,if=jd_light&buff.seal_of_light.down&cooldown.judgement.remains<gcd.max
actions+=/judgement,if=debuff_seal_pending
actions+=/seal_of_righteousness,if=use_sor&need_main_seal
actions+=/seal_of_command,if=use_soc&need_main_seal
actions+=/seal_of_wisdom,if=use_sow&need_main_seal
actions+=/judgement,if=judge_main
actions+=/consecration,if=settings.prot_consecration_single&mana.pct>=settings.consecration_mana_pct
actions+=/exorcism,if=settings.exorcism
actions+=/hammer_of_wrath,if=settings.hammer_of_wrath&mana.pct>=settings.consecration_mana_pct
actions+=/blessing_of_sanctuary,if=!any_blessing&self_blessing_sanctuary
